{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 167124, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 111543, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "地铁介绍（建设中）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1663207504, "updated_at": 1663211939, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1679475152, "last_at": 1679475152, "comment_count": 2, "status": 1, "summary": "前言地铁每天打一次要不要重置可以看看挖矿攻略目录一、什么是地铁二、为什么要打地铁三、怎么通关地铁一、什么是地铁1、地铁由世界地图进入，地铁选项有四种难度，通关一层后可解放下一难度。2、地铁有剧情、我没", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 3, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 24017, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 167124, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">地铁每天打一次要不要重置可以看看挖矿攻略</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">目录</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">一、什么是地铁&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二、为什么要打地铁&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三、怎么通关地铁&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、什么是地铁</span></div></div><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、地铁由世界地图进入，地铁选项有四种难度，通关一层后可解放下一难度。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、地铁有剧情、我没看以后再补吧。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3、地狱地铁在右上方切换，介绍在《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/167124.html\" target=\"_blank\">地狱地铁指路</a>》中查看。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4、特殊机制介绍：（待审核）</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;①下一关继承天子血量、队伍DS能量条、FT累计数值。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;②如果发现阵容打不过或减员，可以按手机的返回键退出该次挑战，返回挑战前的状态，被常称作为SL（玩家黑话指存档读档大法“败者食尘”回到过去，此招式用来在GTA等游戏中赌博效果拔群）</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;③如果达到挑战时间结束显示失败，队伍并不会全灭，而是在下一次挑战的时候保持双方状态（天子血量、DS能量条、FT累计数值），给你换人的机会。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">图片展示部分</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、为什么要打地铁</span></div></div><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、地铁的奖励是每日金币的重要来源，约折算135W（壹佰叁拾五万）其中100W+纯金币（装备默认卖出），1000钻重置一次。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、获得的装备建议卖钱，一是用来强化魂卡的性价比没有买金币高，二是这里除了宇航服（防具）其他的真没用。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3、折算为《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166473.html\" target=\"_blank\">挖矿攻略</a>》中公式计算会略有少量偏差。</span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">地铁收入图片展示</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">三、怎么通关地铁</span></div></div><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、最难的普通地铁极地铁，是有难度的白图里最简单的了，没什么好说的主要是我也不熟最低练度应该怎么通过的，一系列技巧，和做操作达成最低练度通关。有点练度都能过。</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">可参考的阵容及帖子：</div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/81743.html\" target=\"_blank\">皮肤塔攻略</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">》</span>&nbsp;《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/164164.html\" target=\"_blank\">地狱地铁攻略</a><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">》</span>&nbsp;《星云小关 <a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/158846.html\" target=\"_blank\">12</a>-<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/166541.html\" target=\"_blank\">3</a> 攻略<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">》</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "不忘初心", "tag_color": "#FEC700"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 87603334, "content_num": 27, "read_num": 1273844, "like_num": 691}, "update_user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "description": "DC混了一年半，好好玩半年，又要开始混了。", "follow_num": 141, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 5, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/11.png", "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/